WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:05.570
Speaker 1: Let's talk today about why rightwingers
and Republicans seem to hate.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.400
They really seem furious with electric vehicles.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.999
And we've talked about this anecdotally over
the last few weeks.

00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:16.139
There have been these clips of Marjorie Taylor
GREENE making completely incorrect claims

00:00:16.139 --> 00:00:21.480
about people are being enslaved by being forced
to get electric vehicles.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.859
Just completely wacky stuff.

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:27.980
But let's actually think it through a little
bit because when you take it at the top level,

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.090
you would think that right wingers would love
electric vehicles.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.090
Think about it.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.380
They hate and complain all the time about
high gas prices.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.700
Electric vehicles don't use gas, so that would
be something that should appeal to right wingers.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:49.200
Right wingers often have this kind of stereotypical
alpha beta male mentality.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.180
They see fast cars as indicative of alpha
male status.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:57.570
Well, electric vehicles are really fast, so
you'd think that would be something that would

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.820
appeal to them.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.800
They claim to like self-sufficiency and not
depending on others.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:10.530
You can quite literally charge your electric
vehicle at home with solar power harvested

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:15.330
from the solar panels that you own, you don't
need anybody else to help you.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:17.010
You'd think that that would appeal to them.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.370
You don't need a gas station.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:21.710
You don't need a fuel tanker to deliver the
gas to the gas station.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:26.190
Russia can't mess with gas and affect the
gas you get at the gas station.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.430
Think they would love it?

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.190
And sort of along that same line.

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:33.210
I mean, you could end the dependance on foreign
oil as well, which is something right wingers

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:36.900
claim to love, but they don't love electric
vehicles.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.130
In fact, they seem to hate them.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:44.820
And it's another one of these examples where
you have their stated principles and then

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:48.880
you have what's politically convenient or
inconvenient.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:54.240
And the reality is, right wingers tend to
love oil and gas.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:02:01.200
Fossil fuels, they see burning fossil fuels
as a good thing in many cases, and they like

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.150
angering people on the left.

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:08.700
And so there is a part of this that is that
right wingers want to protect the established

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:13.700
industry of oil and gas, both for its own
sake and to anger liberals.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:16.549
And they see electric vehicles as a threat
to fossil fuels.

00:02:16.549 --> 00:02:17.549
And that's true.

00:02:17.549 --> 00:02:20.590
Electric vehicles are a threat to fossil fuels,
and that's a good thing.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:26.459
You also have, you know, the Toyota Prius
specifically has become a sort of emblem,

00:02:26.459 --> 00:02:32.439
a prototype, a microcosm of what the right
doesn't like.

00:02:32.439 --> 00:02:36.549
Right wingers often see the Prius as a very
beta energy vehicle.

00:02:36.549 --> 00:02:39.319
They see it as a form of left wing virtue
signaling.

00:02:39.319 --> 00:02:42.169
Now, the reality is we are very much beyond
that.

00:02:42.169 --> 00:02:45.249
You can get I mean, put Tesla aside.

00:02:45.249 --> 00:02:52.419
You can get a Porsche Electric vehicle, Volkswagen,
Audi, Hyundai, what's more Alpha than a Ford

00:02:52.419 --> 00:03:00.370
F-150 electric, which is sold out until who
knows when, but the stereotype remains and

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:03.959
it conflicts with what right wingers like.

00:03:03.959 --> 00:03:10.180
You've then got the range issue or the supposed
issue, the right wingers sort of idealizing

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.819
the great American road trip.

00:03:11.819 --> 00:03:18.739
They say, Well, on my electric vehicle I can
only go 250 miles on a charge or 275 or 300

00:03:18.739 --> 00:03:22.790
or 330 or 370 or soon to be over 400.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.919
But who actually drives that long without
stopping?

00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:31.790
I mean, seriously, like if you just on a normal
road trip, even if you can fill your tank

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:39.150
with 500 miles worth of gasoline, who's really
driving a full four or 500 miles?

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:42.989
When's the last time you drove 300 miles without
stopping?

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:47.500
It's not really an impediment to the great
American road trip.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:52.930
The right thinks things that the left likes
must be bad things.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:58.430
And since the left, generally speaking, likes
electric vehicles, the right ends up having

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.469
to say that they are bad.

00:04:00.469 --> 00:04:07.879
And it is a very strange thing because when
you actually go point by point, they should

00:04:07.879 --> 00:04:10.079
be loving these electric vehicles.

00:04:10.079 --> 00:04:12.680
Oh, and by the way, I shouldn't forget.

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:18.030
The electric vehicles don't make the big boy
vroom, vroom engine noise.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:21.590
And I think that that's something that right
wingers also don't like.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:26.340
So by all accounts, this is something that
they should embrace if they were paying attention

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.750
to their principles.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:32.880
The principles go in the toilet as soon as
they conflict with what's politically convenient.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.590
And that's exactly what we're seeing right
now

